{"ID":"20240118151350-1rb0en9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151350-1rb0en9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151350-1rb0en9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151350-w9px2on\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240126163031-4qwzgjp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119172742-hcdjjfw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:119,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:119\u0026#125;","title":"044白英","type":"doc","updated":"20240126164144"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151350-w9px2on","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151350-w9px2on","updated":"20240119172726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘寒，主寒热八疽消渴补中益气，久服轻身延年。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119172728-cyf6qo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172728-cyf6qo5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生川泽，为野生蔓草，全草可用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119172730-crgswz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172730-crgswz0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】根苗叶味甘，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119172731-lpcumni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172731-lpcumni"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【效用】白英为解热药，治风疹，丹毒，黄疸及热疟。有补益之效。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119172734-6au860r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172734-6au860r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【弘景】叶做羹饮，可疗劳。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119172735-wo3ox8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172735-wo3ox8k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】烦热，风疹，丹毒，瘴疟寒热，小儿结热，煮汁饮之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119172741-m40kss1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172741-m40kss1"}},{"ID":"20240119172741-witotz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172741-witotz6"}},{"ID":"20240119172742-hcdjjfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172742-hcdjjfw","updated":"20240126164144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第44味白英，白英呢这种是全草，这种药根苗叶全草都可以用，味甘性寒。我们用的不多，因为它这些味甘寒，主消渴补中益气，我们消渴的药非常的多。所以白英近世用的比较少。可不可以用？可以用。到处都有不一定要到四川，到处都有。但这个药用的不多，它是解热的药。诸位有个概念就可以了。那像风疹，小儿，因为它是味甘嘛，甘味的药性寒，寒能够去所有的热病，小孩子的风热啊，发烧啊、风疹啊，风疹通通是热症，丹毒啊通通可以用。"}]},{"ID":"20240126163031-4qwzgjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240126163031-4qwzgjp"}}]}